WEBVTT

1
00:01:20.836 --> 00:01:22.403
♪ I'M GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

2
00:01:22.405 --> 00:01:24.238
♪ GONNA HAVE MYSELF
A TIME ♪

3
00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.574
FRIENDLY FACES EVERWHERE HUMBLE
FOLKS WITHOUT TEMPTATION

4
00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:29.009
♪ GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

5
00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:30.744
♪ GONNA LEAVE
MY WOE'S BEHIND ♪

6
00:01:30.746 --> 00:01:32.446
♪ AMPLE PARKING
DAY OR NIGHT ♪

7
00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:34.248
♪ PEOPLE SPOUTING
"HOWDY NEIGHBOR" ♪

8
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:35.616
♪ HEADED ON
UP TO SOUTHPARK ♪

9
00:01:35.618 --> 00:01:37.684
♪ GONNA SEE IF
I CAN'T UNWIND ♪

10
00:01:37.686 --> 00:01:40.621
( mumbling )

11
00:01:40.623 --> 00:01:42.189
♪ SO COME ON DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

12
00:01:42.191 --> 00:01:45.125
♪ AND MEET SOME
FRIENDS OF MINE ♪

13
00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:16.724
OH MY GOD,
THEY KILLED KENNY !

14
00:02:16.726 --> 00:02:17.758
YOU BASTARDS !

15
00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.293
WHAT THE HELL
IS THAT THING ?

16
00:02:19.295 --> 00:02:20.528
IT LOOKS
LIKE A UFO.

17
00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.630
THERE'S NO SUCH
THING AS UFOs.

18
00:02:22.632 --> 00:02:24.165
( sirens )

19
00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:27.001
LETS GET HIM TO THE MORGUE

20
00:02:32.441 --> 00:02:35.342
HEY, WAIT TIL
YOU GUYS SEE

21
00:02:35.344 --> 00:02:36.110
MY HALLOWEEN
COSTUME TOMORROW.

22
00:02:36.112 --> 00:02:36.777
IT KICKS ASS.

23
00:02:36.779 --> 00:02:37.711
DUDE, IT CAN'T BE
COOLER THAN MINE.

24
00:02:37.713 --> 00:02:38.612
WE OUGHT
TO GET HOME

25
00:02:38.614 --> 00:02:40.648
AND GET OUR
COSTUMES READY.

26
00:02:49.325 --> 00:02:53.494
YOU KNOW, I THINK DEATH IS LEAST
FUNNY WHEN IT HAPPENS TO A CHILD

27
00:02:53.496 --> 00:02:56.997
YEAH I KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN

28
00:02:56.999 --> 00:02:59.133
MARTY, DO YOU HAVE TO PUT THAT
STUFF ON EVERYTHING?

29
00:02:59.135 --> 00:03:03.537
I DON'T KNOW, IT JUST MAKES
EVERYTHING TASTE SO ENGLISH

30
00:03:03.539 --> 00:03:05.105
WELL, LETS LET HIM DRAIN

31
00:03:23.059 --> 00:03:25.125
SO THE NECROPHELIAC SAYS "IF
THIS ISN'T A CADAVER..."

32
00:03:28.364 --> 00:03:29.863
AHH! GODDAM THAT LITTLE TURD BIT
ME

33
00:03:29.865 --> 00:03:31.131
ME TOO

34
00:03:40.476 --> 00:03:42.710
HA HA, YOU LOOK LIKE A PANSY!

35
00:03:42.712 --> 00:03:43.577
SHUT UP KYLE !

36
00:03:43.579 --> 00:03:45.246
WHAT ARE YOU
SUPPOSED TO BE ?

37
00:03:45.248 --> 00:03:46.013
I'M RAGGEDY ANDY.

38
00:03:46.015 --> 00:03:49.383
WHY THE HELL DID YOU DRESS
UP LIKE RAGGEDY ANDY, DUDE ?

39
00:03:49.385 --> 00:03:50.417
WENDY'S GOING
AS RAGGEDY ANN

40
00:03:50.419 --> 00:03:53.754
AND SHE SAID THAT WAY WE'D WIN
THE COSTUME CONTEST FOR SURE

41
00:03:53.756 --> 00:03:54.421
NO WAY DUDE

42
00:03:54.423 --> 00:03:55.823
I'M GONNA WIN
THE COSTUME CONTEST

43
00:03:55.825 --> 00:03:56.991
WITH THIS SWEET
CHEWBACCA COSTUME.

44
00:03:56.993 --> 00:03:59.960
WENDY SAID THAT FIRST PRIZE
IS TWO TONS OF CANDY.

45
00:03:59.962 --> 00:04:01.195
WOW, COOL !

46
00:04:01.197 --> 00:04:01.962
HEY DUDES...

47
00:04:01.964 --> 00:04:03.597
CARTMAN, WHAT KIND OF
COSTUME IS THAT ?

48
00:04:03.599 --> 00:04:08.335
IT'S ADOLF HITLER COSTUME,
SIEG HEIL, SIEG HEIL !

49
00:04:08.337 --> 00:04:10.671
WHERE'D YOU GET THAT?
MY MOM MADE IT,
ISN'T IT COOL ?

50
00:04:10.673 --> 00:04:11.705
NO, IT'S NOT COOL.

51
00:04:11.707 --> 00:04:14.041
WHAT ARE YOU SUPPOSED
TO BE STAN, HOWDY DOODY ?

52
00:04:14.043 --> 00:04:16.243
NO, I'M RAGGEDY ANDY,
FAT ASS.

53
00:04:16.245 --> 00:04:21.282
OH WOW, YOU LOOK PRETTY COOL..HA
HA

54
00:04:21.284 --> 00:04:22.783
I'LL KICK
YOU LOOK PRETTY CYOUR ASS KYLE !

55
00:04:22.785 --> 00:04:25.019
LOOK OUT,
HOLLY HOBBY'S
ALL PISSED OFF.

56
00:04:25.021 --> 00:04:27.788
HEY LOOK,
KENNY'S NOT DEAD.

57
00:04:28.924 --> 00:04:30.724
YOU FORGOT TO WEAR A COSTUME
KENNY

58
00:04:30.726 --> 00:04:31.825
YEAH, WHAT'S
THE MATTER ?

59
00:04:31.827 --> 00:04:32.760
COULDN'T YOUR FAMILY AFFORD A
COSTUME?

60
00:04:32.762 --> 00:04:33.894
YEAH, WHY IS YOUR FAMILY SO POOR
KENNY?

61
00:04:33.896 --> 00:04:35.763
KENNY'S FAMILY IS SO POOR
THAT...

62
00:04:35.765 --> 00:04:41.201
YESTERDAY, THEY HAD TO PUT THEIR
CARDBOARD BOX UP FOR A SECOND
MORTGAGE

63
00:04:42.672 --> 00:04:44.204
HEH HEH HEH HEH

64
00:04:45.274 --> 00:04:46.840
I SAID YOUR FAMILY HAD TO PUT A
CARDBOARD

65
00:04:46.842 --> 00:04:49.209
BOX UP FOR A SECOND MORTGAGE!
KENNY!

66
00:04:51.614 --> 00:04:53.280
I'M TALKING TO YOU KENNY!

67
00:04:53.282 --> 00:04:54.381
ACHTUNG !

68
00:04:54.383 --> 00:04:56.650
POOR PIECE OF CRAP

69
00:04:56.652 --> 00:04:58.252
COME ON,
WE'RE RUNNING LATE !

70
00:04:58.254 --> 00:05:00.788
WE'RE ALWAYS RUNNING
LATE YOU UGLY SCANK.

71
00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.156
WHAT DID YOU SAY ?

72
00:05:02.158 --> 00:05:04.525
I SAID I CAN'T WAIT
TO OWN A FISHING TANK.

73
00:05:04.527 --> 00:05:06.960
OH, NEITHER CAN I.

74
00:05:08.397 --> 00:05:10.497
VERY INTERESTING.

75
00:05:10.499 --> 00:05:11.398
WHAT IS IT,
DOC ?

76
00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:14.301
WELL YOUR TEMPERATURE
IS ONLY 55 DEGREES,

77
00:05:14.303 --> 00:05:16.303
YOU HAVE NO PULSE,
NO HEARTBEAT.

78
00:05:16.305 --> 00:05:19.406
AND YOUR EYES ARE
ALL PUFFY AND STICKY.

79
00:05:19.408 --> 00:05:20.541
OH NO,
YOU MEAN...

80
00:05:20.543 --> 00:05:23.844
YEAH, I'M AFRAID THE TWO
OF YOU HAVE PINK EYE.

81
00:05:23.846 --> 00:05:25.979
I'D GIVE YOU A
TOPICAL MEDICINE

82
00:05:25.981 --> 00:05:27.614
BUT I DON'T WANT
TO TOUCH YOU.

83
00:05:27.616 --> 00:05:28.415
I'M SO HUNGRY

84
00:05:28.417 --> 00:05:30.818
AND ALL I CAN THINK
ABOUT EATING IS...

85
00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:31.618
BRAINS !

86
00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.787
WELL FOR GOD SAKE,
DON'T TOUCH YOUR EYES .

87
00:05:33.789 --> 00:05:36.357
I'LL PRESCRIBE
SOME ANTIBIOTICS.

88
00:05:37.159 --> 00:05:39.793
JUST WAIT TIL EVERYONE SEES MY
SWEET CHEWBACCA COSTUME

89
00:05:39.795 --> 00:05:41.995
THEY'RE GONNA
BE SO JEALOUS.

90
00:05:44.533 --> 00:05:45.132
WHOA, DUDE !

91
00:05:45.134 --> 00:05:46.066
EVERYONE CAME
AS CHEWBACCA ?!

92
00:05:46.068 --> 00:05:52.373
IT SURE DOES SEEM TO BE A
POPULAR COSTUME THIS YEAR KYLE.

93
00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:53.674
DAMMIT!

94
00:05:53.676 --> 00:05:54.575
WENDY ?!

95
00:05:54.577 --> 00:05:55.042
HI STAN.

96
00:05:55.044 --> 00:05:57.311
YOU SAID WE WERE GOING TO
BE RAGGEDY ANN AND ANDY.

97
00:05:57.313 --> 00:05:58.379
REMEMBER ?

98
00:05:58.381 --> 00:05:58.779
YEAH.

99
00:05:58.781 --> 00:06:01.115
WE WERE GONNA ENTER THE
COSTUME CONTEST AS A PAIR.

100
00:06:01.117 --> 00:06:01.648
I KNOW.

101
00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:05.252
BUT THEN I REALIZED
HOW STUPID WE WOULD LOOK.

102
00:06:05.254 --> 00:06:05.853
YOU WHAT ?!

103
00:06:05.855 --> 00:06:09.123
I THOUGHT YOU WOULD REACH
THE SAME CONCLUSION SO,

104
00:06:09.125 --> 00:06:11.358
I CAME AS CHEWBACCA.

105
00:06:13.462 --> 00:06:14.128
HEY STAN,

106
00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.729
YOU LOOK ALMOST PRETTY
ENOUGH TO KISS.

107
00:06:15.731 --> 00:06:18.599
YEAH, YOU WANT TO
BE MY GIRLFRIEND ?

108
00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:22.369
ALL OF A SUDDEN MY COSTUME
IS PRETTY BAD ASS, HUH ?

109
00:06:22.371 --> 00:06:25.305
DUDE, DRESSING UP LIKE
HITLER IS NOT BAD ASS.

110
00:06:25.307 --> 00:06:26.173
YOU'RE JUST JEALOUS.

111
00:06:26.175 --> 00:06:28.575
WHY DON'T YOU GO BACK TO
<i>ENDOR,</i> YOU STUPID<i> WOOKIE.</i>

112
00:06:28.577 --> 00:06:30.310
WOOKIES DON'T
LIVE ON ENDOR !

113
00:06:30.312 --> 00:06:31.412
( shrieking )

114
00:06:31.414 --> 00:06:32.946
WELL AT LEAST MY MOM'S
NOT ON THE COVER

115
00:06:32.948 --> 00:06:34.248
OF "CRACK WHORE"
MAGAZINE !

116
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:35.182
WHAT DID YOU SAY ?!

117
00:06:35.184 --> 00:06:37.251
OKAY, NOW ALL YOU
LITTLE CHEWBACCAS

118
00:06:37.253 --> 00:06:38.285
TAKE YOUR SEATS.

119
00:06:38.287 --> 00:06:41.388
CHILDREN, SINCE TODAY
IS HALLOWEEN,

120
00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.090
I THOUGHT WE SHOULD LEARN
SOMETHING ABOUT

121
00:06:43.092 --> 00:06:45.292
THE GREAT HORROR WRITER JACKIE
COLLINS

122
00:06:45.294 --> 00:06:48.228
YOU SEE, WHEN JACKIE COLLINS
FIRST WROTE HER NOVEL

123
00:06:49.398 --> 00:06:49.730
EWW!

124
00:06:49.732 --> 00:06:51.365
IS THERE A PROBLEM KENNY!?

125
00:06:51.367 --> 00:06:55.702
lETS TRY TO KEEP OUR ARMS TO
OURSELVES OKAY ?

126
00:06:55.704 --> 00:06:57.304
I'M NEVER GONNA WIN
THAT TWO TONS OF CANDY

127
00:06:57.306 --> 00:07:00.441
LOOKING LIKE
EVERYBODY ELSE.

128
00:07:00.443 --> 00:07:04.578
♪ I'M GONNA DECORATE
THE HOUSE FOR HALLOWEEN

129
00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:08.982
WITH SCARY GHOSTS AND BATS AND
CREEPY CRAWLY THEMES

130
00:07:08.984 --> 00:07:12.219
HELLO THERE, HAPPY HALLOWEEN.

131
00:07:12.221 --> 00:07:14.354
MUST EAT BRAINS

132
00:07:14.356 --> 00:07:19.059
♪ IT'S THE MOST WONDERFUL
TIME OF THE YEAR ♪

133
00:07:19.061 --> 00:07:22.863
♪ DOO-DOO-DOO-DOO... ♪

134
00:07:22.865 --> 00:07:24.531
I'M GONNA MAKE A NEW
COSTUME DURING RECESS.

135
00:07:24.533 --> 00:07:25.833
I CAN STILL
WIN THAT CANDY.

136
00:07:25.835 --> 00:07:28.402
HEY KENNY, ARE YOU
GONNA EAT YOUR PUDDING ?

137
00:07:28.404 --> 00:07:32.139
NO ERIC, GO AHEAD
AND EAT MY PUDDING

138
00:07:32.141 --> 00:07:33.040
IF YOU'D LIKE.

139
00:07:33.042 --> 00:07:35.742
WHY THANK YOU KENNY,
HOW NICE OF YOU.

140
00:07:35.744 --> 00:07:36.743
AREN'T YOU
HUNGRY KENNY ?

141
00:07:36.745 --> 00:07:39.847
HE HASN'T MOVED
AN INCH OR SAID ANYTHING.

142
00:07:39.849 --> 00:07:41.148
HELLO CHILDREN.

143
00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.683
HEY CHEF.
HEY CHEF.

144
00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.153
WHAT IN THE HELL
ARE YOU DOING

145
00:07:46.155 --> 00:07:47.120
DRESSED UP LIKE THAT ?

146
00:07:47.122 --> 00:07:48.789
EATING KENNY'S
PUDDING.

147
00:07:48.791 --> 00:07:49.790
HELLO THERE,
CHILDREN.

148
00:07:49.792 --> 00:07:51.658
LOVE THE ELVIS
COSTUME CHEF.

149
00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.660
ELVIS ?
I'M EVEL KENEVEL !

150
00:07:53.662 --> 00:07:55.429
WHY THE HELL WOULD I
DRESS UP LIKE ELVIS ?

151
00:07:55.431 --> 00:07:58.098
WHY THE HELL WOULD YOU
DRESS UP LIKE EVIL KENEVEL ?!

152
00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.434
ANYWAY, I HOPE THAT
YOU KIDS ARE...

153
00:08:00.436 --> 00:08:03.036
ERIC, GOD BLESS IT !

154
00:08:03.038 --> 00:08:04.371
WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE DOING ?!

155
00:08:04.373 --> 00:08:06.874
HE SAID I COULD
HAVE HIS PUDDING,

156
00:08:06.876 --> 00:08:07.774
ASK HIM YOURSELF.

157
00:08:07.776 --> 00:08:10.444
THAT'S RIGHT,
PRINCIPAL VICTORIA,

158
00:08:10.446 --> 00:08:13.747
IT'S OKAY WITH ME
BECAUSE ERIC IS COOL.

159
00:08:13.749 --> 00:08:16.316
WHERE DID YOU GET THAT
COSTUME YOUNG MAN ?

160
00:08:16.318 --> 00:08:17.317
MY MOM MADE IT.

161
00:08:17.319 --> 00:08:19.753
SIEG HEIL,
SIEG HEIL !

162
00:08:19.755 --> 00:08:20.654
SHH...

163
00:08:20.656 --> 00:08:21.488
...GOD BLESS
AMERICA.

164
00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:24.157
YOU GET INTO MY OFFICE
BEFORE ANYONE ELSE SEES YOU.

165
00:08:24.159 --> 00:08:26.827
I HAVE TO SHOW YOU
AN EDUCATIONAL VIDEO.

166
00:08:26.829 --> 00:08:31.031
I DON'T WANT TO SEE
AN EDUCATIONAL VIDEO.

167
00:08:32.401 --> 00:08:34.234
YOU BIT MY ARM !

168
00:08:34.236 --> 00:08:36.136
OH GOOD, KENNY'S BACK TO NORMAL

169
00:08:36.138 --> 00:08:37.471
WATCH THE VIDEO ERIC.

170
00:08:37.473 --> 00:08:40.908
Adolf Hitler was
a very, very naughty man.

171
00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.677
( German )

172
00:08:53.689 --> 00:08:56.990
PPPPA
( German )

173
00:09:00.763 --> 00:09:02.596
So remember kids...

174
00:09:02.598 --> 00:09:06.567
DRESING UP LIKE HITLER IN
SCHOOL, ISN'T COOL

175
00:09:06.569 --> 00:09:08.835
NOW, DO YOU HAVE
ANY QUESTIONS ?

176
00:09:08.837 --> 00:09:10.537
CAN I SEE THAT AGAIN,
THAT WAS COOL !

177
00:09:10.539 --> 00:09:13.307
YOU MUST REMOVE
THAT COSTUME IMMEDIATELY.

178
00:09:13.309 --> 00:09:16.143
I CAN'T, I HAVE TO WIN
THOSE TWO TONS OF CANDY.

179
00:09:16.145 --> 00:09:18.579
WELL HOW ABOUT WE MAKE
YOU A NEW COSTUME ?

180
00:09:18.581 --> 00:09:21.648
LET'S SEE NOW,
UH-HUH...

181
00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.416
THOUGHT OF
SOMETHING.

182
00:09:22.418 --> 00:09:26.820
HOW ABOUT WE MAKE YOU A
NICE SCARY GHOST COSTUME ?

183
00:09:26.822 --> 00:09:31.658
AND LET ME JUST MAKE A FEW
QUICKY ALTERATIONS...

184
00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.227
AND THERE YOU GO
YOUNG MAN.

185
00:09:38.334 --> 00:09:39.366
LOOKS LIKE THEY GOT

186
00:09:39.368 --> 00:09:42.536
A TOUCH OF THAT PINK EYE
THAT'S GOING AROUND.

187
00:09:48.177 --> 00:09:49.142
BOO, I'M A GHOST.

188
00:09:49.144 --> 00:09:52.012
OH MAN, I FEEL
LIKE A TOTAL CHOAD.

189
00:09:52.014 --> 00:09:52.846
C'MON STAN,

190
00:09:52.848 --> 00:09:55.716
MAYBE THAT'S JUST
BECAUSE YOU LOOK
LIKE A TOTAL CHOAD.

191
00:09:55.718 --> 00:09:56.984
HELLO CHILDREN.

192
00:09:56.986 --> 00:09:58.585
HEY CHEF.

193
00:09:58.587 --> 00:09:59.586
AHH !

194
00:09:59.588 --> 00:10:02.789
WHOA'S REALLY
SCARED OF GHOSTS, HUH ?

195
00:10:02.791 --> 00:10:03.824
WHERE'S KYLE ?

196
00:10:03.826 --> 00:10:05.525
CHECK<i> THIS</i> OUT.

197
00:10:05.527 --> 00:10:06.727
WHOA DUDE !

198
00:10:06.729 --> 00:10:07.461
WHAT IS THAT ?

199
00:10:07.463 --> 00:10:08.695
I'M THE WHOLE
SOLAR SYSTEM.

200
00:10:08.697 --> 00:10:10.464
THE PLANETS EVEN
REVOLVE THE RIGHT WAY.

201
00:10:10.466 --> 00:10:12.299
THAT TUB OF CANDY
IS AS GOOD AS MINE.

202
00:10:12.301 --> 00:10:15.602
OKAY CHILDREN,
LET'S GET YOU LINED UP

203
00:10:15.604 --> 00:10:19.373
SO THE JUDGE CAN GET A GOOD LOOK
AT YOUR STUPID LITTLE COSTUMES

204
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:21.308
THIS YEAR WE HAVE
A CELEBRITY JUDGE,

205
00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.176
THE STAR OF
"FAMILY TIES",

206
00:10:23.178 --> 00:10:24.878
MISS<i> TINA YOTHERS.</i>

207
00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.613
WHO? I THOUGHT SHE WAS DEAD

208
00:10:26.615 --> 00:10:27.981
YEAH, ME TOO.

209
00:10:27.983 --> 00:10:28.882
THANK YOU MISS YOTHERS

210
00:10:28.884 --> 00:10:34.087
OKAY, THE SECOND PLACE AWARD FOR
BEST COSTUME GOES TO...

211
00:10:34.089 --> 00:10:39.059
KENNY! FOR HIS EDWARD JAMES
ALMOS COSTUME

212
00:10:39.728 --> 00:10:44.765
AND THE AWARD FOR THE VERY BEST
COSTUME GOES TO..

213
00:10:44.767 --> 00:10:48.068
WENDY! FOR HER CHEWBACCA
COSTUME

214
00:10:48.537 --> 00:10:50.437
WHAT!? BUT SHE LOOKS JUST
LIKE EVERBODY ELSE.

215
00:10:50.439 --> 00:10:53.573
UP YOURS,
TINA YOTHERS !

216
00:10:53.976 --> 00:10:57.144
AND THE AWARD FOR WORSE
COSTUME THIS YEAR GOES TO...

217
00:10:57.146 --> 00:10:59.713
STAN, FOR HIS STUPID LITTLE
CLOWN THING COSTUME

218
00:10:59.715 --> 00:11:02.149
LETS ALL POINT AT STAN AND LAUGH
CHILDREN

219
00:11:02.151 --> 00:11:05.118
HA HA HA HA HA

220
00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.019
THANKS A LOT
WENDY,

221
00:11:06.021 --> 00:11:07.587
YOU RUINED
MY HALLOWEEN.

222
00:11:07.589 --> 00:11:08.288
RELAX STAN,

223
00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.791
YOU'LL FEEL BETTER ONCE
WE'RE OUT TRICK OR TREATING.

224
00:11:10.793 --> 00:11:12.793
I DON'T WANT TO
TRICK OR TREAT WITH YOU,

225
00:11:12.795 --> 00:11:13.860
YOU LIED TO ME !

226
00:11:13.862 --> 00:11:14.394
OKAY CHILDREN,

227
00:11:14.396 --> 00:11:16.596
LET'S ALL GATHER AROUND AND
BOB FOR STUPID APPLES NOW.

228
