470
00:20:19.574 --> 00:20:20.974
YEAH.

471
00:20:20.976 --> 00:20:23.476
The regular sauce,
the first thing
you need to do

472
00:20:23.478 --> 00:20:24.978
IS MAKE SURE THAT
YOU DO NOT JUST GO OUT

473
00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:27.380
AND START DECAPITATING
ZOMBIES LEFT AND RIGHT.

474
00:20:27.382 --> 00:20:28.181
DO YOU UNDERSTAND ?

475
00:20:28.183 --> 00:20:29.482
DO NOT START
DECAPITATING

476
00:20:29.484 --> 00:20:31.317
zombies left
and right.

477
00:20:31.319 --> 00:20:33.653
OKAY, THEN WHAT ?

478
00:20:33.655 --> 00:20:35.321
WENDY, I KNOW
WE HAD A FIGHT

479
00:20:35.323 --> 00:20:36.756
AND I DID WISHED
YOU WERE DEAD,

480
00:20:36.758 --> 00:20:38.124
BUT I DIDN'T
MEAN IT.

481
00:20:38.126 --> 00:20:38.791
KILL HER, STAN.

482
00:20:38.793 --> 00:20:40.660
ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS KILL
THE ORIGINAL ZOMBIE.

483
00:20:40.662 --> 00:20:42.228
THE ONE THAT STARTED
THE WHOLE MESS.

484
00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.229
ONCE YOU KILLED
THE ORIGINAL ZOMBIE,

485
00:20:43.231 --> 00:20:45.431
ALL THE OTHER ZOMBIES
WILL TURN BACK TO NORMAL.

486
00:20:45.433 --> 00:20:46.032
ORIGINAL ZOMBIE ?

487
00:20:46.034 --> 00:20:48.134
HOW THE HELL DO WE KNOW
WHO THE ORIGINAL ZOMBIE IS ?

488
00:20:48.136 --> 00:20:51.037
WE REALIZE YOU
HAVE A CHOICE IN
WORCESTERSHIRE SAUCES,

489
00:20:51.039 --> 00:20:52.472
WE ARE DELIGHTED THAT...

490
00:20:52.474 --> 00:20:54.907
WAIT A MINUTE,
THAT THING LANDED ON KENNY

491
00:20:54.909 --> 00:20:57.310
AND THEY TOOK HIM
TO THE MORTUARY.

492
00:20:57.312 --> 00:20:59.979
I CAN'T.

493
00:21:07.656 --> 00:21:10.990
OH MY GOD,
I KILLED KENNY !

494
00:21:10.992 --> 00:21:13.826
YOU BASTARD!

495
00:21:13.828 --> 00:21:17.397
WHAT HAPPENED? STAN?

496
00:21:17.399 --> 00:21:19.632
DON'T WORRY BABE, EVERYTHING'S
GONNA BE OKAY

497
00:21:19.634 --> 00:21:21.267
THEY'RE TURNING
BACK TO NORMAL.

498
00:21:21.269 --> 00:21:21.901
YOU DID IT
CHILDREN !

499
00:21:21.903 --> 00:21:25.271
OKAY, LETS GO TICK OR
TREATING NOW, C'MOM!

500
00:21:25.273 --> 00:21:28.074
I'M SORRY I DISSED YOU
AT SCHOOL LIKE THAT
STAN,

501
00:21:28.076 --> 00:21:32.378
I GUESS I JUST WASN'T VERYO
CONSIDERATE OF YOUR
FEELINGS.

502
00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.146
THAT'S OKAY WENDY.

503
00:21:33.148 --> 00:21:34.580
I'M SORRY I WISHED
YOU WERE DEAD.

504
00:21:34.582 --> 00:21:38.217
MAYBE WE CAN ACTUALLY
KISS TONIGHT, STAN.

505
00:21:41.289 --> 00:21:45.958
BLAH!, SICKGROSS STAN

506
00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:51.998
BARF IS GROSS.

507
00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.966
OH MAN, I CAN'T
BELIEVE HE'S GONE.

508
00:21:53.968 --> 00:21:56.202
YEAH, HE WAS TOO YOUNG
TO BE TAKEN FROM US.

509
00:21:56.204 --> 00:21:58.104
DUDE, YOU'RE THE ONE
WHO CUT HIM IN HALF

510
00:21:58.106 --> 00:21:58.938
WITH A CHAIN SAW.

511
00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:01.207
LET US REMEMBER
THE GOOD TIMES.

512
00:22:01.209 --> 00:22:04.243
KENNY WOULD
HAVE WANTED IT.

513
00:22:08.383 --> 00:22:09.582
YOU KNOW, I'VE REALLY LEARNED
SOMETHING TODAY

514
00:22:09.584 --> 00:22:11.451
HALLOWEEN ISN'T ABOUT COSTUMES
OR CANDY

515
00:22:11.453 --> 00:22:14.387
IT'S ABOUT BEING GOOD TO ONE
ANOTHER, AND GIVING AND LOVING.

516
00:22:14.389 --> 00:22:16.723
NO DUDE,
THAT'S CHRISTMAS.

517
00:22:16.725 --> 00:22:17.690
OH.

518
00:22:17.692 --> 00:22:19.325
THEN WHAT'S
HALLOWEEN ABOUT ?

519
00:22:19.327 --> 00:22:20.593
COSTUMES AND CANDY.

520
00:22:20.595 --> 00:22:22.295
OH.

521
00:22:22.297 --> 00:22:24.864
WELL LET'S GO HOME AND
START EATING THAT CANDY.

522
00:22:24.866 --> 00:22:26.132
WE CAN EAT IT AT
CARTMAN'S HOUSE

523
00:22:26.134 --> 00:22:28.201
AND SEE MORE NAUGHTY
PICTURES OF HIS MOM.

524
00:22:28.203 --> 00:22:28.735
YEAH.

525
00:22:28.737 --> 00:22:29.569
KNOCK IT OFF
YOU GUYS !

526
00:22:29.571 --> 00:22:31.471
SHE SAID SHE WAS YOUNG
AND NEEDED THE MONEY.

527
00:22:31.473 --> 00:22:35.074
CARTMAN, THOSE PICTURES WERE
TAKEN LIKE LAST MONTH

528
00:22:35.076 --> 00:22:38.511
SCREW YOU GUYS

529
00:22:45.587 --> 00:22:47.587
GRRMPH..GRRMPH

